    {
      "id": "normal-boundary-operators-completion-to-full-orders",
      "type": "ordinary-paragraph",
      "regions": [
        [
          321,
          80,
          1100,
          955,
          1290
        ]
      ],
      "en": "The orders of the $B_j$ cover only half the values from $0$ to $2m-1$. We can add additional boundary operators $S_j$, $j=1,\\ldots,m$, to fill in the missing orders. Obviously, we can do this in such a way that the extended set of boundary operators still satisfies the conditions of normality; we merely have to take $S_j$ to be the appropriate powers of $\\partial/\\partial n$. We make the following definition.",
      "zh": "$B_j$ 的阶数只覆盖从 $0$ 到 $2m-1$ 的一半取值. 可以添入边界算子 $S_j$, $j=1,\\ldots,m$, 补齐缺少的阶数. 显然可以使扩充后的边界算子组仍满足正规性条件; 只需取 $S_j$ 为 $\\partial/\\partial n$ 的适当幂即可. 作如下定义.",
      "label": null,
      "render_role": "ordinary-paragraph",
      "source_locations": [
        {
          "pdf_page": 321,
          "printed_page": 311,
          "bbox": [
            31.980547112462006,
            439.7776373973468,
            381.7677811550152,
            515.739229311434
          ],
          "bbox_precision": "visually selected parent block, top-left PDF points",
