    {
      "id": "dirichlet-system-tangential-triangular-reduction-lemma",
      "type": "lemma",
      "regions": [
        [
          322,
          80,
          145,
          955,
          425
        ]
      ],
      "en": "Let $F_i(\\bm{x},D)$, $i=1,\\ldots,p$, be a Dirichlet system, and suppose the order of $F_i$ is $i-1$. Then there exist tangential differential operators $\\Phi_{ij}(\\bm{x},D)$ and $\\Psi_{ij}(\\bm{x},D)$, of order $i-j$, such that\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:dirichlet-system-tangential-triangular-reduction}\n\\begin{aligned}\nF_i(\\bm{x},D)&=\\sum_{j=0}^i\\Phi_{ij}(\\bm{x},D)\\frac{\\partial^{j-1}}{\\partial n^{j-1}},\\\\\n\\frac{\\partial^{i-1}}{\\partial n^{i-1}}&=\\sum_{j=0}^i\\Psi_{ij}(\\bm{x},D)F_j(\\bm{x},D).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\end{equation}\n",
      "zh": "设 $F_i(\\bm{x},D)$, $i=1,\\ldots,p$, 为 Dirichlet 系统, 并设 $F_i$ 的阶数为 $i-1$. 则存在 $i-j$ 阶切向微分算子 $\\Phi_{ij}(\\bm{x},D)$ 和 $\\Psi_{ij}(\\bm{x},D)$, 使得\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:dirichlet-system-tangential-triangular-reduction}\n\\begin{aligned}\nF_i(\\bm{x},D)&=\\sum_{j=0}^i\\Phi_{ij}(\\bm{x},D)\\frac{\\partial^{j-1}}{\\partial n^{j-1}},\\\\\n\\frac{\\partial^{i-1}}{\\partial n^{i-1}}&=\\sum_{j=0}^i\\Psi_{ij}(\\bm{x},D)F_j(\\bm{x},D).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\end{equation}\n",
      "label": "lem:dirichlet-system-tangential-triangular-reduction",
      "render_role": "lemma",
      "source_locations": [
        {
          "pdf_page": 322,
          "printed_page": 312,
          "bbox": [
            31.980547112462006,
            57.9706885660139,
            381.7677811550152,
            169.91408717624762
          ],
          "bbox_precision": "visually selected parent block, top-left PDF points",
          "crop": "workspace/crops/chapter-09-batch-22/dirichlet-system-tangential-triangular-reduction-lemma-322.png",
          "raw_ocr": "workspace/raw-text/pdf-0322.txt"
        }
      ],
      "formula_ids": [
