        ]
      ],
      "en": "The existence of the $\\Phi_{ij}$ is obvious from the definition. The $\\Psi_{ij}$ are then obtained by inverting the triangular matrix of the $\\Phi_{ij}$. We leave the details of the proof as an exercise; see Problem~\\ref{ex:dirichlet-system-triangular-reduction-details}.",
      "zh": "$\\Phi_{ij}$ 的存在性由定义显然可知. 然后将 $\\Phi_{ij}$ 构成的三角矩阵求逆, 即可得到 $\\Psi_{ij}$. 证明的细节留作练习; 见 Problem~\\ref{ex:dirichlet-system-triangular-reduction-details}.",
