    {
      "id": "dirichlet-system-prescribed-trace-corollary",
      "type": "corollary",
      "regions": [
        [
          322,
          80,
          550,
          955,
          650
        ]
      ],
      "en": "Let $F_i$, $i=1,\\ldots,2m$, be a Dirichlet system, and let $m_i$ denote the order of $F_i$. Let $g_i\\in H^{2m+k-m_i-1/2}(\\partial\\Omega)$ be given. Then there exists $u\\in H^{2m+k}(\\Omega)$ such that $F_iu=g_i$ on $\\partial\\Omega$.",
      "zh": "设 $F_i$, $i=1,\\ldots,2m$, 为 Dirichlet 系统, 用 $m_i$ 表示 $F_i$ 的阶数. 给定 $g_i\\in H^{2m+k-m_i-1/2}(\\partial\\Omega)$. 则存在 $u\\in H^{2m+k}(\\Omega)$, 使得在 $\\partial\\Omega$ 上有 $F_iu=g_i$.",
      "label": "cor:dirichlet-system-prescribed-traces",
      "render_role": "corollary",
      "source_locations": [
